      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so my doctor put me on quetiapine (seroquel) for my sleep/anxiety stuff but it wasnt really working well enough to knock me out. i have some leftover diazepam (valium) from a bad panic attack last month... would it be okay if i take both tonight so i can actually sleep through the night? i just need something to help me chill out",
